        "id": 1039387
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T14:25:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "object_open, object_read and object_read_metadata release the GIL, but object_write (here), object_write_metadata (line 76) and object_tombstone (line 83) don\u0027t. Object::write() and write_metadata() block in commit() until the transaction is durable, so every PUT chunk and POST holds the GIL for the whole disk wait.",
      "revId": "633054551671766058f39473e6d1a1a88bf1906c",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
